{"id": "Ddbu9HxPWnH", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"MODELS\" to get access and start building with these top video models.\n\nYou don't need a subscription to use the top AI video models anymore.\n\nHiggsfield just opened their whole catalog through a single API key.\n\nSo you've got Seedance, Kling, Nano Banana, and more, all in one place.\n\nThere's no plan sitting underneath any of it either.\n\nYou load up a wallet, and pay for what you actually generate.\n\nYou can even check what something costs before you run it.\n\nThink of it like a vending machine instead of a monthly gym membership, you only pay when you actually use it.\n\nMost platforms lock their best models behind a subscription tier you have to commit to first.\n\nThis flips that entirely, you just top up your balance and start building.\n\nNo monthly fee ticking away in the background whether you use it or not.\n\n#higgsfieldai #HiggsfieldAPI #aivideos #genai #videogenerator", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789744535, "like_count": 1193, "comment_count": 1590, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1824426915220355a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.194, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNHg3NZwNfVvSisv6kiVo2ZMRN0D3F3fytO32RHrwaqlgeEw88NA3hxhWOlTx9f8Jay5YIg1ZsWGwCxdDgxZPkVlvke_5Uk8KCjwmo.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrCoS7RAxXnmZJQ3ixQw65VMzGigUeLH7VZRBRSKtU5NsyEGWNHOCQ7gv_0FWfP2FU&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=htmcvfhBQGgQ7kNvwFZi9NO&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=cg6lPofiG3h8z8JdH1cxbw&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRqbVOS6qD6Mz8w-EOUenGx95CZTX9A2-S3KjEohhbEcA&oe=6AE609FA", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext"